readme.songs:
# Songs of {name}

{name} downloads songs into this folder and keeps them up to date. Every song source has its own folder in here.

Please don't put your own files here and don't use this folder for anything else. You can choose another folder in the settings of {name}.

readme.content:
# {label} for {name}

{name} installs {label} into this folder for the game and keeps them up to date. A file with the same name as an installed file is replaced; other files you put here stay.

Please don't use this folder for anything else.
